Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut\Nthrough the wind and make a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,stand The paint within\Nbrings out a map of your own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the\Nright all we saw stormy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,nights All the rough\Nwinds and waves coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,day after day And the values we had were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,about to collapse Oh\Njust where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning bright. For what's ahead you\Nsee. Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone, we'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The page\Nwithin brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I'm a lover, but I'm also a\Nfighter, man or woman, I like it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to find a good punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're just the perfect size
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smack his face in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie K!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,for the record these webs aren't just here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to block you they're\Nalso extremely flammable
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,what was it you said this will\Nbe over before you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you're nothing but talk\NYou thought you were
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,some kind of hero coming\Nto Blacklegs' rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're every bit as weak as he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you'll make a fool of\Nyourself just like he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, little flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to blow me the sea of flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know your wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wither and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That demon child shouldn't\Nbe allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,do this world a favor and\Ndie you little heathen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just like i told you you're a\Nliability a burden to your crewmates
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you would think you're something\Nspecial powerful people from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,all over the world have their eyes\Non you because you can read the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bone glyphs, but that's it. You're\Njust a tool to them as long as they
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,can use you who needs a personality\Nwho needs arms who needs legs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a tramp like you in your place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It is just so satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look. You ran all over the\Nplace, and now the entire hall is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,on fire You made a real mess\NCall your friend here A skeleton
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,With a sword, he'll clean up your\Ntrash like last time. If he cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to bother These are very foolish\Nthings you're saying, Black Maria,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and I suspect you'll be\Nregretting your actions shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd run if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to learn to punch! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like hitting people with my fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about a\Nlife-or-death struggle here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a slap won't be enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How about using your palm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know palm strikes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on speed over strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw it quick and pull it back quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, meet your new secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Claw Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, who invited you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach Robin, so you buzz off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it doesn't\Nmatter who teaches her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't even a teacher, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fishman karate assistant instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin's grappling techniques\Nare all she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried, because we won't be able\Nto protect her anymore after she leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.28,0:06:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, she's perfectly capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But our fishman karate techniques would\Npair so well with Robin's fighting style.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as well as my techniques\Nwould, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She has her own way of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great for palm strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but it would be devastating\Nwith the dragon claw fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or her palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let Robin speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still something I\Nwant to hear you say, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never thought about becoming\Nstronger for someone else's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop worrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this Why don't you\Nstop worrying and let me handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right A palm strike\Nsounds perfect Show me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mind sharing\Nyour secret techniques?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not Why would I mind\Nyou're one of us we love you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:08:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this when you're in a tight\Nspot, you can use this palm strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Fishman Karate secret art.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.44,0:08:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This meant Karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantium!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you even aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A pawn strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put my pawns to\Ngood use again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Find your enemy's core, then strike it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the core, then strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. The fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She planned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people in this\Nworld who need me Who love
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,me and rely on me And I'd do\Nanything for them Anything
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even turn into a demon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The grand jacuzzi lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.84,0:10:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Black Maria's going in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that tramp is begging for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs arms and legs, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It ate my arms and legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about yours, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Black Maria? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid skeleton in a stupid ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Lady Black Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Black Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm considerate of you all to line up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll make this much easier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dom's Orchestra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Robin. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Park, for waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I'm a little tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you appreciate\Nmy situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a whole month's worth\Nof my food you're eating, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You better return the favor once\Nwe're done with this whole mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you have so much food\Nwith you in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the power of my swamp, Swamp\NFruit, I'm like a bottomless pit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the captain up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still alive? Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Eel Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please use your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm capable of doing it, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy needs me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Help him? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle must be won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means we're going back up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, how could you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Going back to that place is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, you must!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lose, then nowhere we'll be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just the capital, but\Nthe land of Guano itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm as frightened as anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that, I need your aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My power only works one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do what you ask,\Nthere's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The years that you sacrificed\Nwill never return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind will remain the same, but\Nyour body will become that of an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After all you've been through, a\Nsacrifice like that is simply too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What I need right now is to\Nbecome a full-grown dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never do such an awful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my lord,\Nbut you must reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you, we can\Nfind another way. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please use your right "Right" Jutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and make me into an adult i'll grow
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,up for my country and for its
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,future you must use your power on me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the 5 400 troops of the\Nsamurai pirate alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,made a raid on onigashima\Nfacing 30 000 beast pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but that gap in numbers\Ndiminished in time thanks to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,otama's kibidango strategy\Nand the valiant efforts of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's allies all over the\Nisland now, even the high
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-ranked tobiropo have been\Ndefeated yet onigashima
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,continues its trek to the\Nmainland and soon its dark
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow will loom over the\Nunsuspecting flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you serve that wretched beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that Orochi has\Nno right to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.39,0:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As ninja, our duty is to serve the\NShogun, not question his legitimacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,KUNKUCHU!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You call Odo Shield wretch, but\Nyou serve a failure, a mere ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak ill of war, Odin. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You always let your emotions\Nget the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a true ninja. Buries\Nsuch weaknesses, even your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,mighty techniques will
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:17:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,fit you it is those very
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,emotions that drive us that\Ngive us joy and purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,every moment we spent with\Nlord odin was a gift we cried
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,together we laughed together\NAnd when our Lord died,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we died with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We are but ghosts now, bound by\Nthe thread of Lord Odin's dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duty is not some burden to bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our pride, emboldened by every\Nfeeling we shared with Lord Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream worth dying for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the darkness of Orochi\Nand Kaido will come to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And tomorrow will bring\Na bright future to Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a new arrow will be poured\Nwith Lord Momonosuke Ashokan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How many stand-ins do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Precious few, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:17:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You've butchered them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a waste of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, you great
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But the question is, whose\Nlives do they contain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like something just
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,stabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't tell me it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was having fun for a\Nmoment. I thought you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,might cut your own\Ncaptain to shreds without
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,realizing it was him but that's all right\Nnow that you know you can't win i'll enjoy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,watching you fall deeper and deeper into
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,despair your vow to defeat\Nme has been rendered
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,meaningless you can only strike me down by\Nkilling your beloved partner you bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It tickles my imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking of all the uncertainty and\Nsuffering you're hiding behind that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.26,0:19:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Entertain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The price of betrayal\Nis very steep indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even your new Straw Hat pals can\Nsave you from what you've got coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's execution time, and you\Nrats are getting banned alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.32,0:20:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Markham go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's reached his physical limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to do this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sangoro, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, it just tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fight both of them at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want us to find Zoro\NJudo so he can finish him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, boss head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it normally take this long to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it used with\Nsuch extensive injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Miyagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If the drug's not working, take Mummy\NJohto and get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We injected him, so it\Nshould take effect soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting, Zoro! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find some\Nway to stop those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, they're going to wipe\Nout everyone on the entire floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave him some strange treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't allow him any time to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't turn your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Real cute, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you\Nbastards cut down anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimwitted Dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.46,0:22:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You kicked up so much\Ndust I can barely see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lickety-stickety\Nyou, Vinsmoke Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had married pudding\Nlike mama planned we wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,be here right now teaming\Nup with a bunch of idiots
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him, Master. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, worthless jammer scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to avenge Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I found Toro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's butcher him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.42,0:23:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the Beast Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro Juno fought for Wado, so\Nwe'll fight to protect him. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Those samurai are all wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finish them off at\Nthe same time as Roanua!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what's\Ngoing to happen to Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, King Paul Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.30,0:25:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really making me work\Ntoday, aren't you, Mosshead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.48,0:25:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get out of our way, Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.28,0:25:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.14,0:25:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.14,0:25:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A dying thistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.06,0:25:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a story about this long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.84,0:25:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of the Great Red Wall, To dwelled a\Nrace of people who can burst into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,King the wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.32,0:26:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.28,0:26:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates off the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.60,0:26:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.56,0:26:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.00,0:26:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm satisfied now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hogged the spotlight for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.44,0:26:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for the\Nreal star to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.30,0:27:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.80,0:27:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabli!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.28,0:27:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.72,0:27:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oniagiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Straw Hats, where to show us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.03,0:27:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.68,0:27:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm worried about later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Curly Browns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.34,0:28:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens if\Nwe win this battle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cross the threshold\Ninto the final stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and get a glimpse of Luffy\Nbecoming King of the Pirates.
